\textbf{3} \textbf{Principles of Bonsai Trees}

In this section we lay out the framework and main techniques for the
cultivation of bonsai trees. There are four basic principles: undirected
growth, controlled growth, extending control over arbitrary new growth,
and randomizing control.

\textbf{3.1} \textbf{Undirected Growth}
\end{quote}

